Manifold DSA is released under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International license
(CC BY-NC-ND 4.0). It was created specifically for DSA and non-profit use.

In plain terms:

  Attribution      Credit the typeface where it is used or redistributed.
  NonCommercial    Do not use it for commercial projects.
  NoDerivatives    Do not modify it. That includes subsetting, re-hinting, or
                   converting it to another format. The web font files served
