## Archivo and Spline Sans Mono (the fallback / accent typefaces)

Archivo and Spline Sans Mono are released under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1), copyright the Archivo Project Authors and the Spline
Sans Mono Project Authors respectively (both via Google Fonts). Unlike
Manifold DSA above, the OFL permits modification, including subsetting: the
files served from /fonts/archivo/ and /fonts/spline-sans-mono/ are Latin-subset
WOFF2 builds (the weights this site actually uses: 500-900 for Archivo,
500-700 for Spline Sans Mono), vendored from the @fontsource/archivo and
@fontsource/spline-sans-mono packages (github.com/fontsource/font-files,
itself built from google/fonts). Each font’s own OFL-1.1 text is alongside it
at /fonts/archivo/LICENSE and /fonts/spline-sans-mono/LICENSE.

These two used to load from fonts.googleapis.com/fonts.gstatic.com at every
page view, sending every visitor’s IP address to Google. They are self-hosted
now so that no longer happens; nothing else about how they render changed.
